    "title": "Qiziqishlarim",
    "language": "html",
    "description": "«Qiziqishlarim» sahifasini yasang: head da favicon, bitta h1, kamida uchta img (src, alt, width), bittasi - figcaption li figure da, bittasi alt=\"\" li bezak rasmi, controls va source li video. autoplay siz.",
    "starter_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"uz\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Qiziqishlarim</title>\n    <!-- sayt belgisi -->\n</head>\n<body>\n    <main>\n        <h1>Qiziqishlarim</h1>\n        <p>O‘zingiz haqingizda gapirib bering.</p>\n        <!-- figure: alt va width li rasm + figcaption -->\n        <!-- alt=\"\" li bezak rasmi -->\n        <!-- alt va width li yana bir rasm -->\n        <!-- controls va source li video -->\n    </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
